<strong><p>Service disruption notice: business name and company registrations</p></strong>
<p>We are currently experiencing an intermittent issue that may affect business name and company registrations.</p>
<p>You may experience issues completing your registration or making a payment.
If you are unable to complete your registration, please try again later.</p>
<p>We apologise for any inconvenience and are working to resolve the issue as quickly as possible.</p></div><button type="button" class="closeSystemMessage" onclick='document.cookie = "testMessageVisible=false";'>Dismiss</button></div>





<div id="homepage" class="content container">
    <div id="headingHome" class="pagehero">
        <h1 class="mt-5 mb-4">
            <span id="headerpretextline" class="preHeading mb-3">
                Welcome to the Australian Government
            </span>
            <span class="mainHeading">Business Registration Service</span>
        </h1>
        <p id="headerbyline" class="byline"><p>Here you can apply for your key business and tax registrations in one place.</p><p>Not sure which registrations you need? Use our tool to help you <a href="https://business.gov.au/registrations/work-out-your-business-registrations" target="_blank"> work out your business registrations</a>. <a class="cd-btn help" href="#help-businessregistrationsdescription"><span>Help - Business Registration Service</span></a></p>
</p>
    </div>

